{"server":"cn","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_08_beg","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_08","title":"童话的开场","storyCode":"SS-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c0a841f8aa965d6a00e86bb3496f0abab97642dc80f4a031fce435a7973def53","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deluxeroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"从几十层高的天台往下看，地面上的车与人都渺小如尘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若麦小姐，我们已经加强了你住处附近的安保，请你这段时间减少外出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在绑架犯还没抓到，出于安全考虑，公司建议你暂停这段时间的活动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂停活动......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是一段时间，我们会重新筛选合适的合作方，以确保你的绝对安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那喜欢我的粉丝们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若麦小姐，你现在是龙门当红的明星，希望你能意识到自己的人气有多高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间你可以去休假，或者做一些自己感兴趣的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——唯独不要乱跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局又过来联系我们了，我需要去应付一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好待着，不要乱跑......吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"若麦环顾自己的家——\n如果它能被称为“家”的话。\n客厅里永远只有一个人看的超大电视。\n每天都有人来收拾的床铺，看上去永远都是崭新的。\n突然，她的目光被一样东西所吸引。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"也许并不是刻意遗忘，而是她不愿去寻找。\n在某个时刻，是她自己选择放弃了它。\n那是书柜角落里的一副鼓棒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（敲击鼓棒）......一，二，三，四。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......打得好烂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你放走了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你违抗了我的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，这次的交易算我违约，违约金在这。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海铃从口袋中掏出了一袋金币，将它放在了老爷面前的桌上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你拒绝了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想了很久，我们还是继续保持雇佣关系吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是更适合独来独往，真要有什么作伴的话，我也想选我的贝斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，你想回去找弗朗西斯他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对他们的音乐派对感兴趣很久了。对不起，你口中的更大的牌桌，我是没法坐上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈......我什么时候说让你上牌桌了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你从来都只是“筹码”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不握在自己手里的筹码，一文不值。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老爷话音刚落，会客室的门立刻就被推开，一群身材健硕的打手将海铃团团围住。\n海铃将目光移回老爷身上，一把铳已经明晃晃地对准了她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"narration","text":"小岛离船越来越远，就要从视野中消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么啦，怎么一直回头看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才，我好像听见有谁在叫我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，肯定是你听错啦。这海上除了风浪声和羽兽声，还能有什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（打量）你提这么多行李，是要去大城市打拼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我要去找一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巧了，怎么又是一个要找人的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（大声）海浪突然变大了......"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知何时，头顶的天空变得昏暗起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（更大声）危险......抓紧......护栏......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"可是一切为时已晚。\n巨浪重重地砸在了甲板上，汹涌的海水瞬间灌入每一个舱室。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g9_warmrabbitnest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对......不对......不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉他的声音......不对。"},{"type":"narration","text":"可是她心里非常明白，古典吉他永远发不出电吉他的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）小睦，已经很晚了，该睡了哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的父亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）不管怎么说，请你先把房门打开吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）嗯，就和以前一样，我们陪在你的身边，给你讲睡前故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非你们告诉我，祥......她到底去哪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这，我们也不知道啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说不定，她也去了其他地方，找到了自己的幸福呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......说谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥，不是那样的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"门外一片寂静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥不会这样轻易改变的，她想要我回到Ave{@nbs}Mujica——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母亲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小睦也不能轻易改变哦。"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知何时，母亲已经站在了睦的身后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母亲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不只是你的梦，也是我们的梦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”们","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都是睦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”们","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们共同的梦，我们都能真实存在、都能幸福的梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”们","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小睦不需要祥子，小睦只需要我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”们","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们，永远，永远，在一起吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩子们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爱丽丝姐姐，贝娜姐姐，再见啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见，再见！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要遵守我们许下的约定，做一个好孩子哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩子们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱丽丝，贝娜，准备好了？准备好我们就——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子小姐......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱丽丝......项链......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"项、项链？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你左边的口袋里——那条放在小匣子里的可以避免做噩梦的项链！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子小姐，你在说什么，我没......欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"爱丽丝下意识地将手伸进了口袋中，没想到却感到了一丝意外的凉意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子......难道你真的会预言？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"narration","text":"舞台中央，睦倒在了一片血泊之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"孩子呀！我的孩子呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母亲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快救救她！快救救她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导演","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她怎么样了？受伤了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女主角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可怜的孩子，她真的死了！太可怕了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男主角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"骗人的，她没死！这种事情怎么能信呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"其他演员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（喧闹的哼唧声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"其他演员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（兴奋的哼唧声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沃尔夫，你演得实在太烂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃尔夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起。表演不是我的强项。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（欢乐的嬉笑声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们以为自己就演得很好吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（慌乱的哭闹声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，台上的演员还不够......还缺一个......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫菲丝死死地盯着舞台的最中央——座椅上，蓝发的少女正闭着眼，可她的眉宇间仍是挣扎的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（失落的哼唧声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃尔夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这部戏是一个叙拉古的剧作家写的，据说刚上演时，还引起了不小的争议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真真假假，假假真真，追究那么清楚又有什么意义呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人总是喜欢对一件事追根究底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃尔夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许，这是人之所以为“人”的缘由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃尔夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我又多言了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......沃尔夫，你能顺畅地说话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃尔夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是最近排演的次数变多......也可能是最近见到的事情颇多，心中有了些感悟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"编织的造物也会有“心”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃尔夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"书上说，铁皮人也能拥有心，我应该也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，我就不该让你看那么多书......还不如结巴呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她没有“心”了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我能把她再缝补起来，但没有心的她，没法再走出这里了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你来决定吧......决定莫菲丝的命运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（爱丽丝姐姐......贝娜姐姐......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，你还是不要说话比较好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，和我一样就好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲丝，你的闹剧，该结束了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"舞台上，原本沉睡的人偶站了起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，怎么回事？这怎么可能？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样！不应该啊，你怎么能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，在唤醒我的伙伴前，我是不会走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给你两个选择——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要么现在立刻从我眼前消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要么等着我用一层层的梦境把你困住，让你直接昏迷在“无梦之境”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你敢？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子将手伸进了口袋中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯，果然还在。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"爱丽丝的项链穿越了层层梦境，陪她来到了这里。\n现在，她要拯救Ave{@nbs}Mujica，拯救所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的赌约，还没有结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在她们的梦里，我见到了她们每个人的内心所想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们心中的愿望一一被实现，可她们却并不幸福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们并非虚伪，只是心中依然迷茫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为Ave{@nbs}Mujica的发起者，我向她们许诺了，我将会对她们的人生负责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从我说出这句话起，我们的命运就不可分割......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面对迷途的人偶，我应当为她们指明方向，我必须带领她们走出迷雾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"丰川祥子站在舞台中央，环顾身旁沉睡的伙伴们，又将视线转向莫菲丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是迷途的人偶......也包括你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"月光洒下之时，人偶获得暂时的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醒来吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拦下她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（恐怖的嘶吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这里是我们的梦境，那我们才是这里的主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只会成为我们想要成为的样子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"丰川祥子缓缓抬起了手，她的装束也随之变化。\n她回想起梦里自己学习的源石技艺，回想起自己想要写的曲子。\n就像她无数次练习的那样，手指坚定地落下——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i11"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的手落在一枚白色琴键上。\n音符清晰地传到了台上台下的每个角落，也让牵引着人偶的丝线脱力。\n人偶们失去了控制，一个个倒在了巨大的舞台上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g1_rainystreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间以来，Ave{@nbs}Mujica的大家都在努力付出，我怎么能懈怠呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即使面对各种困难和麻烦，我们最后不依然完成了属于“我们”的化装舞会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想写一首歌——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"写我们的挣扎，还有我们未来的可能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们是一个乐队，是命运共同体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我的回答。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g9_warmrabbitnest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小睦，放下吉他吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是我们的公主，不论你做什么，我们都会陪在你的身边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——捂住她的耳朵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抱紧吉他）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的很想念祥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁能帮帮我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真拿你没办法。"},{"type":"narration","text":"原本扑在睦身上的“睦”们，像突然失去控制的提线人偶，一个接一个地倒下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然是小睦发自内心的愿望，我会好好倾听的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"narration","text":"全副武装的打手们，正一点点朝海铃逼近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海铃，该结束了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？这曲子是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海铃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗朗西斯......你怎么会从天而降？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子全和我们说过了，其实我们都是你梦境里的造物吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你们会相信她说的那些胡话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你难道不觉得很合理吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因为我们是你创造出来的，所以才会从一开始就那么相信你啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自从接受了这件事，我整个人都变轻松了。海铃，我现在可是无所不能哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间不多了，你赶快离开这个噩梦吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要怎么离开......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你的梦境，你肯定知道吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我离开以后，你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么时候变得这么扭扭捏捏了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心好了，我和兄弟们举办派对的时候，会想念你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别让她跑了——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"海铃抓紧琴盒的提手，微微屈膝，将重心慢慢下移——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯&兄弟们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海铃大姐头，一路顺风！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deluxeroom"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若麦小姐......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"音响正用最大音量播放着大家从未听过的歌。\n而房间里空无一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快通知安保公司！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的保安","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"她、她开直播了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大家好喵姆喵姆~我是喵姆亲~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵姆亲现在正在龙门上空滑翔！哈哈，后面还有几十辆警车在追我哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊~真开心！喵姆亲现在的样子，大家一辈子都不会忘记吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们还能留下记忆的话，还有一点也请记住——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喵姆亲是Ave{@nbs}Mujica的鼓手——Amoris！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g12_seabed"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（记忆......在一点点消失......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（最后一点关于她的回忆，也在慢慢被抹除......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（那首歌......那首歌......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（灵魂之歌......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（第一个......降临的人......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（我说......你属于我......你属于我......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（看吧......分明近在咫尺......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（光......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（你就像光一样......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（你总有力量，让大家聚在你的身边，享受你的光芒和温暖......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（这就是你啊......小祥。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i11"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"narration","text":"一遍遍地演奏，内心一遍遍地呼喊，不曾停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，我曾经无数次伤害过你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但此时此刻，我比任何人都想见到你们——见到真实的你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ave{@nbs}Mujica是命运共同体。因为肩负着你们的人生，所以我也会赌上人生来守护你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托了......各位，请醒来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"午夜，双月悬于夜空之上，当为人偶苏醒之时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重启吧......Ave{@nbs}Mujica的世界。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
